  "wall": {
    "text": "M31 (q milestone 7: 1e60 total quirks, then Auto-Space Buildings switched on) is the wall: not reached by the 130,000 cap. The record has 1.99e51 total quirks at 130,000 game-s, 10^8.7 short. Each quirk cash-in under sg-keep's ×2 rule triples the total, so 1e60 needs about 18 more cash-ins; from 120,000 to 130,000 there were about 4 (1.74e49 → 1.99e51) and the runs between them keep getting longer, so at this pace M31 is far past 150,000 game-s. M32 (Improvements Galore, q44) came first, at 114,018.5. The 11th Quirk Layer costs about 1e65 quirks, past the goal itself; More Layers and Improvements Galore are bought, so no remaining quirk upgrade lowers the wall."
